{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "唐善導和尚"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "同上"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "宋永明禪師"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "同上"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "並"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "慈照宗主"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "虎谿尊者"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "同上"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "明蓮池大師"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "同上"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "憨山大師"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "蕅益法師"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "知皈學人"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "同上"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "終"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "三節三拜"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "凡有生命，乃至魚蝦蚤蝨之類，俱不得殺，能放生者更善"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "凡非我所有，乃至一針一芥不得故取，能布施者更善"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "凡非其匹\n偶，俱不得犯，能永斷慾事者更善"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "凡無實之言，乃至呪詛惡罵，俱不切發，能勸人\n\n為善者更善"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "自不飲酒，亦不得教人飲酒，能長齋不晚食者更善"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "如月小，則\n用二十八、二十九"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "見《地藏經》"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "或千聲或三千聲"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "各十聲"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "文見前"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "唐"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "宋"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "此節語載《龍舒淨土文》第十一卷，云出王敏仲《直指淨土決疑集》。今《決疑集》已不傳，而世間通行《淨土文》祗有\n十卷。恐漸湮沒，故錄其文，與《萬善同歸》一節，並列如右。"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "明"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "終"}
